# {{.ProviderShortName}} Provider

{{ .Description | trimspace }}

## Limitations

Terraform cannot manage these parts of a Slack workspace:

- Reminders: the reminders API was retired in 2023.
- Workflow Builder workflows and triggers: Slack has no API to create them.
- Posting messages and files: they are one-time events, not resources with a lifecycle.
- Custom emoji outside Enterprise Grid: Slack has no API to add them.
- OAuth installation of an app: the flow is interactive.
- Slack Connect invitations: they are interactive and expire.
- Unarchiving channels: `conversations.unarchive` requires a user token, and this provider uses a bot token.
- Converting channel privacy: Slack has no API to convert a channel between public and private.

